&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Demo Architect, you&#39;ll help GitLab teams and customers get hands-on with our platform faster and with less friction. This role reports to the Senior Director of our Solutions Architecture Center of Excellence, with day-to-day partnership from the current team lead. You&#39;ll build and improve the tools, applications, and infrastructure that support field team demos, workshops, trials, and internal test environments across the field.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What makes this role unique is its mix of software engineering, infrastructure, and customer-facing collaboration. You&#39;ll work like an engineer for much of the role, while also partnering with Solutions Architects, Account Executives, Customer Success, and others to make sure what we build is practical, usable, and aligned to how the field sells.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain tools, applications, and workflows that support demos, workshops, trials, and internal test environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expand the Demo Architect Portal to improve automation, self-service, and scalability for field teams and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provision and support infrastructure that enables hands-on customer experiences across&lt;a href=&quot;https://gitlab.com&quot;&gt; GitLab.com&lt;/a&gt;, demo instances, and internal environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Solutions Architects, Account Executives, Customer Success, Marketing, Revenue Operations, UX, and Engineering to understand needs and deliver practical technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and document go-to-market workflows (e.g., how teams run demos/workshops/trials) and automate the steps that waste time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create technical workshop assets and enablement content that support pre-sales and technical selling for individual contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on sales opportunities when specialized technical demo support or custom solutions are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the presenter experience by reducing manual setup work and making demo workflows easier to use and repeat.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support internal teams that rely on demo or test infrastructure, helping keep those environments available and useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot urgent demo/workshop environment issues under pressure and communicate status clearly to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building software, systems, or internal tools that support technical users or business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to deliver production-grade software and automation with attention to reliability, maintainability, and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across application development and infrastructure, with comfort navigating provisioning, automation, and service workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with monitoring/observability tools to shorten investigation time when something breaks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort communicating and collaborating with technical and non-technical stakeholders across Sales, Solutions Architecture, Customer Success, Marketing, UX, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to design and iterate on solutions for usability and repeatability, not just technical correctness, with awareness that the end user may be a seller or Solutions Architect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate independently in a remote, asynchronous environment, with willingness to travel periodically for team offsites and occasional in-person planning/whiteboarding sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to technical demos, workshops, trials, or enablement assets, and/or interest in learning the pre-sales context; transferable experience from software engineering, site reliability engineering, systems engineering, solutions architecture, or similar technical paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the Demo Architect team at GitLab, we support the field’s demo, workshop, and trial experiences by maintaining shared tooling and the infrastructure behind internal demo and test instances used across GitLab. We’re a small, globally distributed group that collaborates asynchronously across regions and adapts quickly to changing needs, with a current focus on scaling automation, enabling more self-service, extending support to partners, and maintaining reliable internal infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The UK&amp;amp;I Solutions Engineering team guides Okta customers through their entire journey, from initial engagement to upsell and cross-sell, using their expertise in presentations, events, and meetings to ensure customers drive maximum value from our platform. We are looking for great teammates that can build sales presentations, product demonstrations, and educate customers (everyone from developers to product managers to C-level executives) on Identity Security.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta’s Solutions Engineers empathise with customers and quickly discern their true technical needs by asking detailed and clarifying questions and presenting solutions that target those needs. You have the rare combination of technical savviness and business insight and you’re looking for a career where you can utilise both. As a Solutions Engineer at Okta, you will hone each of these skills by advising a diverse set of customers on what is possible using Okta’s Identity Platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Involved in all stages of the customer’s sales lifecycle in the role of trusted technical advisor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building sales presentations, product demonstrations, and educate customers (everyone from developers to product managers to C-level executives) on the best ways to secure identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathise with customers and quickly discern their true technical needs by asking detailed and clarifying questions and presenting solutions that target those needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using your technical savviness and business insights, you will hone each of these skills by advising a diverse set of customers on what is possible using Okta’s Identity Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring to the role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion to serve the customer, with experience working within PreSales (e.g. Sales Engineer, Solutions Engineer, PreSales Consultant)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to quickly communicate complex ideas around a technical topic, ideally on the fly at a whiteboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of and/or experience with at least one standard network security protocol (eg. OIDC, OAuth2, SAML, LDAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of and/or experience in identity governance and administration (IGA): identity lifecycle management, access reviews, role-based access control (RBAC), and policy enforcement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of and/or experience in Privilege Access Management (PAM): familiarity with concepts such as least privilege, just-in-time (JIT) access, session monitoring, and vaulting privileged credentials to secure critical assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of core security concerns within a typical application (password hashing, SSL/TLS, encryption at rest, XSS, XSRF)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of sales methodologies and best practice, including awareness of MEDDPICCC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Large Enterprise and/or Strategic sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and an ability to articulate business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to disperse knowledge to a highly skilled and experienced audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy travel and meeting customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy collaborating with cross functional teams to drive success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;And extra credit if you have experience in any of the following!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Identity &amp;amp; Access Management, Single Sign-on and API-based solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, MIS or a comparable field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Software Developer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-JP3&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Marketing Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to: Chief Commercial Officer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;UK, France, Netherlands, Belgium, Germany, Austria, Spain, Finland, USA. Some travel to our offices will be required from time-to-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You must have the right to work in one the above countries in order to be considered for the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💼 About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is looking for a Product Marketing Director who can turn complex technology into stories that people understand, remember, and act on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own how PQShield&#39;s products, technology, and vision are positioned, communicated, and brought to market worldwide. You&#39;ll sit at the intersection of product, engineering, sales, customers, and the broader security market — translating breakthrough cryptography and security technology into compelling narratives for executives, engineers, partners, and buyers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for a strategic product marketer and exceptional storyteller who can identify the market shift, understand the customer problem, and turn complex technology into differentiated positioning that creates urgency, preference and demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since NIST published its first post-quantum cryptography (PQC) standards, which the PQShield team co-authored, organizations across semiconductors, automotive, defense, and enterprise face significant challenges in preparing for the post-quantum transition. This role will help define the market narrative around that transition, position PQShield&#39;s portfolio within it and give customers a clear reason to act.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⚒️ What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the story: Develop the narrative, positioning, messaging, and value propositions that explain what is changing in the market, why customers need to act, the problem PQShield solves, and why our approach is differentiated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn technical capability into customer value: Work with cryptographers, engineers and product leaders to understand sophisticated technology, identify what matters to the buyer and translate technical capabilities into clear business and security value without sacrificing technical credibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position the portfolio: Own positioning and messaging for our hardware IP and software portfolio, including PQPlatform, PQPerform, PQCryptoLib, and PQMicroLib. Build a clear messaging architecture that connects the portfolio while preserving the differentiated value of each offering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the customer: Develop deep insight into customer problems, buying journeys, security requirements, regulatory pressures, barriers to adoption, buying dynamics, and the forces driving post-quantum adoption. Turn those insights into sharper products, messaging, and go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape category and market narrative: Help define how PQShield talks about post-quantum security, cryptographic agility, and the transition to quantum-safe systems — and how we differentiate our approach in a rapidly evolving market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product launches: Create and execute compelling go-to-market strategies for new products, certifications, partnerships, and major releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip the sales team: Build compelling presentations, stories, solution briefs, case studies, battlecards, and other tools that help sales teams communicate value and win complex deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build buyer and segment-specific stories: Develop differentiated narratives for semiconductors, automotive, military and aerospace, industrial IoT, networking, and enterprise, adapting the value story for different buyers, use cases and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own competitive storytelling: Understand the competitive landscape and turn technical and commercial differences into clear, credible differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create exceptional content: Lead the development of white papers, thought leadership, application notes, customer stories, executive content, web experiences, and other material that establishes PQShield as a category leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer stories to life: Find and develop the stories that demonstrate why customers are making the transition to post-quantum security and why they choose PQShield.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across the company: Partner closely with product, engineering, sales, partnerships, and leadership to ensure the market sees one clear, compelling PQShield story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 Required Skills And Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced product marketing leader who is exceptionally strong in positioning, messaging and strategic storytelling. You can take an emerging market, complicated buyer problem or deeply technical product and find the clear narrative inside it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of marketing experience, with significant experience in product marketing, technology marketing, B2B marketing, or a closely related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to develop positioning and stories that change how markets understand a product, technology, or company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills. You can take something highly technical and make it understandable, interesting, and compelling without dumbing it down.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong storytelling instincts and the ability to find the human, business, and strategic narrative inside complex technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing technical B2B products, ideally in cybersecurity, semiconductors, infrastructure, embedded systems, software, or another sophisticated technology market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of security and technology buyers, and the ability to communicate credibly with CISOs, CTOs, engineers, architects, product leaders, and business executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work closely with technical experts and quickly develop enough subject-matter expertise to challenge assumptions, ask good questions, and tell an accurate story.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong commercial mindset: you understand that great marketing isn&#39;t just about explaining a product — it&#39;s about creating differentiation, urgency, preference, and ultimately revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching products and taking complex offerings to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing compelling sales narratives and enablement for complex, multi-stakeholder sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic judgment, with the ability to determine what the market needs to hear, why it matters, and how PQShield should say it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-moving environment where you will often need to create the narrative before the market has established one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive compensation package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A remote first company. You will work from home most of the time, but will need to join us in the office for planning sessions and key meetings as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel for customer meetings and marketing events as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO and holiday package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions towards 401K/pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;…and other great benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy working as part of a technology company, value the security of our daily digital lives, and love solving hard problems - then we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;PQShield is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer. We’re passionate about talent and proud to foster an inclusive environment; all applicants will be considered regardless of their gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, and age.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia was built to help users deliver an intuitive search-as-you-type experience on their websites and mobile apps. We provide a search API used by thousands of customers in more than 100 countries. Billions of search queries are answered every month thanks to the code we push into production every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the AI Search Group: Enhancing Core Search Capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Relevance Group is dedicated to advancing the core search experience by improving both pre-query relevance (Understanding) and post-query relevance (Re-Ranking). We&#39;re responsible for key customer-facing features like Query Suggestions, Dynamic Synonym Suggestions, AI Re-Ranking, and Query Categorization. We’re looking for problem solvers with an entrepreneurial mindset—people who focus on outcomes and use data to drive decisions. If you&#39;re passionate about optimizing search relevance and applying AI thoughtfully to achieve measurable results for customers, we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team is composed of engineers, with different skill sets and backgrounds. Your experience, your knowledge and your perspective will add to this diversity and help the team deliver products that make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU WILL:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a key contributor to the design and development of ranking &amp;amp; understanding features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a team that includes a variety of roles, ranging from front-end developers to machine learning specialists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be responsible for the quality and soundness of our pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU MIGHT BE A FIT IF YOU HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and operating pipelines in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large datasets and high traffic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An interest in solving Ranking challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building and maintaining API services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rigor in high code quality, automated testing, and other engineering best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using one of the major cloud providers (GCP, AWS or Azure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent spoken and written English skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating AI models in production environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Go or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensitivity to data driven decision making, and exploring datasets with SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensitivity to end user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary compensation range for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€67.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€94.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1812 - Business Director, Biddable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP 650&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join an award-winning team at the heart of UK government, where your work will genuinely shape lives. As part of WPP 650 you’ll be part of a supportive, collaborative environment that values curiosity, kindness, and growth. Together, we use behaviour change principles to design smarter services, influence better decisions, and help millions of people across the country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Named WPP 650, after the 650 UK parliamentary constituencies, the name is a reminder that our work must reflect the full breadth of the country, every community, every audience. No two days are the same. The challenges are complex, the problems worth solving, and the learning constant. You’ll tackle issues that matter, alongside talented colleagues who care deeply about what they do. It’s demanding – but always rewarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is meaningful work with real-world impact – the kind you can point to with pride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Biddable Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you will provide strategic leadership within the Media Activation team, driving excellence across both Paid Search and Paid Social for key clients. This leadership role delivers category-defining capabilities and services across biddable media, ensuring optimal campaign performance and maximizing in-channel effectiveness and data integrity across all relevant platforms. You will lead and develop Biddable activation teams, cultivate strong client and supplier relationships, and define advanced Biddable strategies that align with business objectives and drive growth. Your expertise will provide rigorous and innovative recommendations across both Paid Search and Paid Social, ensuring continuous optimization and adherence to best practices, and strategically weaving Biddable into overall cross-channel campaign strategies within the WPP Open ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Line Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide day-to-day leadership, coaching, and development to direct Biddable activation teams (including Account Managers and Account Executives), fostering excellence and professional growth. Support capacity planning and resource management, leading recruitment for your immediate team and assisting with wider team recruitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Biddable Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and lead advanced Biddable strategies for client portfolios, ensuring clear alignment with business objectives, KPIs, and industry context across both Paid Search and Paid Social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic insight for client product areas within Biddable media, and proactively spot trends, product releases, and opportunities to enhance activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the development and creation of Biddable best practices, with ultimate accountability for adherence to controls and effective oversight of designated campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop thought leadership pieces and case studies to galvanize the role of Biddable within the wider media community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Partner Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong relationships with key clients and suppliers, leading team communications with these stakeholders and providing useful insight independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead efforts to gather and disseminate client intelligence to understand and meet their business needs, navigating critical business changes and complex issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage team members to deliver consistently across multiple Paid Search and Paid Social campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key biddable point-of-contact for clients, maintaining their confidence in the team&#39;s output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee operational excellence, including financial accuracy, data integrity, and end-to-end campaign management processes across Biddable channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for activation issues, troubleshooting, and resolving conflicts between best practice and client requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation by building annual learning agendas and comprehensive test plans for assigned portfolios, fostering continuous optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to agency-wide continuous improvement projects regarding processes and quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead through vision, values, and model leadership behaviours while championing and facilitating change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong commercial acumen, leading on the delivery of services in line with client objectives, service level agreements, and terms of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop ways of working that maximise client output whilst minimizing operational input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Biddable Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Extensive experience (e.g., 7+ years) in digital media, with specialization across both Paid Search (Google Ads, Bing Ads) and Paid Social (Meta Ads Manager, TikTok, Pinterest, etc.). Proven track record of driving performance for clients across biddable channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience with planning and directly managing large-scale Paid Search (PPC) and Paid Social campaigns. Experience with Google stack and relevant certifications (e.g., Google Ads, Meta Blueprint) desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Analytical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong understanding of optimization levers &amp;amp; testing approaches. Excellent analytical skills (quantitative analysis) and proven critical thinking capability to interpret complex campaign data and derive actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; People Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven Project Management, Leadership, and People Management Experience, including responsibility for career development, managing people/teams, and leading hybrid teams (e.g., local teams or cross-functional teams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client &amp;amp; Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proven ability to build strong relationships with key clients and suppliers/vendors, leading team communications and driving workstreams independently. Experience in internal and external stakeholder relationship management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to articulate complex strategies and performance insights clearly and persuasively to diverse audiences. Self-starter who can proactively influence clients to help evolve best practices and drive innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrated Perspective:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Strong understanding of how Paid Search and Paid Social integrate into overall cross-channel campaign strategy and the wider media landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Context:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Desirable experience working in a global context to drive localization and adoption of biddable best practices and running campaigns across multiple countries/languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Passion for biddable media, active interest and understanding of online advertising industry trends, and proactive in evolving best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be Extraordinary by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity. Create an Open environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust. Lead Optimistically by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media includes investing in our employees to help them do their best work, and we’re just as committed to employee growth as we are to responsible media investment. WPP Media employees can tap into the global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, grow their networks, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. We have a variety of employee resource groups and host frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our benefits include competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;1316 - Director, Implementation - MM&amp;amp;D&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;EssenceMediacom:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;EssenceMediacom, part of WPP, is a new breed of media agency. Grounded in analytics &amp;amp; insights and powered by data &amp;amp; technology, we believe in the power of media and creative to drive breakthroughs for the world’s best brands. We help clients understand the modern marketing paradox and discover the breakthroughs brands need to win with their consumers. We are designed for the new communications economy — built on data &amp;amp; technology, built for people &amp;amp; algorithms, built around diverse schools of thought, built to test &amp;amp; learn at scale, and, crucially, built to evolve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Implementation Director to oversee media planning for several clients, including Flutter Group, Tesco and BT. The role centres around ensuring we deliver industry leading implementation recommendations, founded in insight, delivering business results and forging deeper relationship with clients. The candidate will require extensive media planning experience, with a proven track record in delivering industry leading media solutions for clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within this role you will have involvement throughout the entire media planning process, ensuring the comms brief is fit for purpose and ladders back to measurable outcomes, pulling the strategy through into implementation recommendations and ensuring the buying of media stays true to the approach. You will also be responsible for leading the Implementation planning output of the team below you, whilst helping the agency to acquire new clients via new business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Implementation Director you would work directly with the Implementation Partner as part of the Implementation Leadership team to refine, expand and improve our product, leveraging the strength of WPP while ensuring it is fit for purpose for all of EM’s clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp;amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Extraordinary&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Leading Collectively&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Inspire transformational Creativity.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;environment by&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Balancing People and Client Experiences&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Cultivating Trust&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Optimistically&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Championing Growth&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;and Development&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Mobilize the Enterprise&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of industry leading work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in running a large team and managing development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To lead by influence and example to inspire and motivate the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A commercial approach so all decisions/proposals are aligned to the commercial objectives of the agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A deep understanding of how to plan media across brand and response&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence the most senior and demanding clients/Directors/internal stakeholders to gain commitment and drive decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Knowledge of industry media planning tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be able to pro-actively forge relationships with media owners, resulting in innovation opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record for developing new ideas that have sound business benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to spot new trends and disruptions before they hit the mainstream and implement them to create better work for our Directors and/or clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear understanding of the challenges our clients face in the industry and uses this to work proactively to find solutions and deliver value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to extract and filter relevant insights / research to support planning decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to tell compelling implementation stories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sell (consultative selling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine interest in industry research and new ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at&amp;nbsp;WPP Media&amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also Lead Optimistically, firmly believing in and Championing Growth and Development for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to leverage the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the cutting edge of marketing and advertising. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We Create an Open environment built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events showcasing team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
